# Ignore Visual Studio temporary files, build results, and user-specific files

## User-specific files
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

## User-specific folders
.vs/
.vscode/

## Build results
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
x64/
x86/
[Aa]ppx/
[Aa]ppxPackages/
[Tt]est[Rr]esults/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/

## Entity Framework Migration files (optional)
*_MigrationHistory/

## Crash reports and debug logs
*.stackdump
*.log
*.trace

## NPM/Yarn dependency folders
node_modules/
bower_components/

## Publish output
wwwroot/
publish/
dist/

## IDE-specific settings
.idea/
*.code-workspace
*.swp

## Database and configuration
*.mdf
*.ldf
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
*.bak
appsettings.*.json

## Rider project files
.idea/

## Miscellaneous
*.tmp
*.cache
*.diff
*.orig
*.rej

# Ignore files specific to Clean Architecture
src/**/bin/
src/**/obj/
tests/**/bin/
tests/**/obj/

# Allow Solution files
!*.sln
